    proofPrompt: 'Show that complete-line input, full numeric parsing, boundaries, and branch order protect the decision before any success result is printed.',
    proof: ['Final source and warning-enabled build command', 'Six-case expected-versus-actual record', 'Evidence that Mary Ann remains one input value and 18 years is rejected', 'Broken &&/|| result, repair explanation, and final rerun'],
