    proofPrompt: 'Show that each algorithm, lambda capture, iterator check, sort rule, and map operation matches a written intention without hidden collection mutation.',
    proof: ['Final source and five-record fixture', 'Six-case algorithm results including missing iterator and exact threshold', 'Original/copy and stored/transformed before-after evidence', 'Invalid comparator behavior, strict repair, and final deterministic order'],
